  "term": "AMI",
  "definition": "AMI stands for acute myocardial infarction, a serious heart condition that begins suddenly, can worsen quickly, and carries major risks of death and disability. In this context, it is discussed as a medical event whose hospital course and recovery may be linked with psychological and social factors.",
